<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-brand-muted">{siteConfig.tagline}. Promemoria WhatsApp automatici, installazione done-for-you, nessun canone mensile.</p>
<div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
<a href="#contatto" class="rounded-lg bg-brand-accent px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white">Prova gratis 14 giorni</a>
<a href="#come-funziona" class="rounded-lg border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-brand-text">Vedi come funziona</a>
</div>
